K AND $0.378 PER SHARE ON CLASS B COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON MARCH 13, 2020, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON FEBRUARY 28, 2020. COMPANY ANTICIPATE THE REMAINING QUARTERLY DIVIDENDS IN FISCAL 2020 WILL BE $0.42 AND $0.378 PER SHARE OF CLASS A AND CLASS B STOCK, RESPECTIVELY. THIS RESULTS IN AN ANNUAL DIVIDEND RATE IN FISCAL 2020 OF $1.68 FOR CLASS A SHARES AND $1.512 FOR CLASS B SHARES, OR A 12% INCREASE COMPARED TO THE FISCAL 2019 ANNUAL DIVIDEND RATE.'}